00:02:21.019 --> 00:02:25.989
little bit. He sacrificed his daughter--awful
thing--hoping that the payoff long-term would

00:02:25.989 --> 00:02:30.409
be worth it. So the Davos is going to react to Stannis in a similar way that Olly is reacting

00:02:30.409 --> 00:02:35.819
to Jon Snow. Next question. Noah asks: so is
there no leader of the Harpy then? Hizdahr

00:02:35.819 --> 00:02:40.239
